        date: '2025 · 11 · 10', duration: '7 min 20 s',
        cover: '/assets/img/heht-007-cover.jpg',
        summary: 'The higher ed discourse is exhausting. Joel calls for less hot air and more hot takes — but the kind backed by real work and real stakes.',
        chapters: [
          { time: '00:00', label: 'Introduction' },
          { time: '02:00', label: 'Discourse vs Action' },
          { time: '04:30', label: 'Leading by Example' },
          { time: '06:00', label: 'Final Thoughts' }
